# 👤 Tiny Player System

## 👤 Tiny Players

Tiny Players experience the Giant at a completely different scale. Their small size is a gameplay advantage as well as a challenge.

## 🧰 Gadgets & Powers

Tiny Players can use gadgets and powers to navigate, survive, counter Giant actions, and complete objectives. The exact list is not finalized.

## 🧗 Movement Possibilities

Potential gameplay can include navigating around the Giant, climbing sections of the Giant, using routes, avoiding hazards, and exploiting the environment.

## 🎯 Design Goal

Tiny Players should feel clever and capable, not simply weak because they are small.

